  "id": "beef-curry",
  "name": "Beef Curry",
  "subtitle": "Slow-simmered beef with warm spices and tomato",
  "description": "A rich, gently spiced curry of tender braising steak in a tomato-based sauce, finished with garam masala, cream, and coriander.",
